1
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,130
Here, let me feed you.

2
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,220
Nine hundred years have passed.

3
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,690
So much has changed here.

4
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,580
What's changed?

5
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:42,370
You don't remember a thing?

6
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,130
Remember what?

7
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
Luoliang Immortal Sect is an odd one.

8
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,980
Of the Five Great Sects,

9
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,860
it's the only one that doesn't use seals

10
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:51,500
to keep mortals out.

11
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,490
They built a city

12
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,980
where immortals and mortals live together.

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,130
A city this rich is more my style.

14
00:00:58,390 --> 00:00:59,350
Mount Zhaowu, with its awful food

15
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:00,260
and ugly clothes,

16
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:00,940
can't compare.

17
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:01,940
Why don't you

18
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,980
put off looking for the malice

19
00:01:04,310 --> 00:01:05,200
and give me a few more days

20
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,020
to enjoy the good life?

21
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:08,840
Master Cang,

22
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,410
welcome.

23
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,210
Upstairs, please.

24
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:13,020
This way.

25
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:16,260
Here, sir. Have a drink.

26
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,260
All right.

27
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:17,570
Here.

28
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,540
One more cup.

29
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,270
Everyone now knows

30
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:27,130
about the fake saintess.

31
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,380
And with the Immortal Sect Token in the wrong hands,

32
00:01:29,950 --> 00:01:31,540
the immortal sects are in chaos.

33
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,260
They say the Five Great Sects are joining forces

34
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,380
to forge the Demon-Slaying Sword.

35
00:01:34,790 --> 00:01:35,740
At a time like this,

36
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,020
how does Master Cang

37
00:01:37,070 --> 00:01:37,900
have time to come here?

38
00:01:38,310 --> 00:01:39,410
It's all this chaos

39
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,100
among the immortal sects

40
00:01:40,310 --> 00:01:40,930
that has brought

41
00:01:41,070 --> 00:01:41,980
his headaches back.

42
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:43,130
Whenever they flare up,

43
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:44,100
he comes to the Veiled Moon Pavilion.

44
00:01:44,590 --> 00:01:45,210
Besides,

45
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,050
a divine sword

46
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,650
takes more than a day to forge.

47
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,470
He can head over

48
00:01:48,470 --> 00:01:49,540
when they're finishing up.

49
00:01:49,790 --> 00:01:51,110
Why waste time waiting around

50
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:51,900
at Mount Zhaowu?

51
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:53,740
- True. - Demon-Slaying Sword?

52
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:54,620
My Lord,

53
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:55,730
Duyao was an impostor,

54
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:57,690
but the Saintess's divine power was real.

55
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,540
How about...?

56
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,900
Before they finish forging the Demon-Slaying Sword,

57
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,570
I have to reclaim the malice.

58
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,410
But...

59
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:31,260
Even with the Wanjun Lock gone,

60
00:02:32,470 --> 00:02:34,340
I still can't untangle the malice from obsession.

61
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,670
They mentioned

62
00:02:37,670 --> 00:02:38,940
Cang Zhu's headaches just now.

63
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:39,940
What causes them?

64
00:02:41,630 --> 00:02:42,960
Why would the Veiled Moon Pavilion

65
00:02:43,030 --> 00:02:45,060
ease his symptoms?

66
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:13,500
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

67
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:21,500
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

68
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:26,780
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

69
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:38,020
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

70
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:45,140
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

71
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:53,020
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

72
00:03:54,220 --> 00:04:01,060
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

73
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:09,180
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

74
00:04:13,940 --> 00:04:15,740
[Blossom in Darkness]

75
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:17,740
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

76
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:20,740
[Episode 23]

77
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,370
Who dares put on airs

78
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:23,370
at the Veiled Moon Pavilion

79
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:24,220
and demand to see me?

80
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:24,990
Madam,

81
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,170
I really can't tell

82
00:04:26,310 --> 00:04:27,140
who

83
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:28,170
that gentleman inside is.

84
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,980
But he's handsome and well-educated.

85
00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:31,850
He's not someone we'd want to cross.

86
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,540
This is Luoliang Immortal City.

87
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,580
You think I haven't seen

88
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,900
my share of nobles pass through?

89
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:38,250
Human or ghost,

90
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,730
I can tell at a glance.

91
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:41,340
Besides,

92
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:43,020
this place is backed by the sect leader.

93
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,490
Who'd dare cross us?

94
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:57,140
My master has a question for you.

95
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,100
Just ask, sir.

96
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,540
I'll tell you everything I know,

97
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,460
down to the last detail.

98
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,410
What's causing Cang Zhu's headaches?

99
00:05:09,310 --> 00:05:10,660
Word has it

100
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,660
every dancer he's seen over the years

101
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,220
looks like one particular woman.

102
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,460
Who is she?

103
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,460
Our sect leader is a generous man.

104
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,290
He lets mortals like us

105
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,170
settle in this sacred land.

106
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:30,170
We take care with what we say and do.

107
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,780
Who are we to pry into his affairs?

108
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,220
I'll ask you once more.

109
00:05:36,950 --> 00:05:38,370
Who is that woman?

110
00:05:43,190 --> 00:05:44,980
"With a heart like a mirror free of dust,

111
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,150
ride the icy currents

112
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,490
to cleanse the body stained by slaughter.

113
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,220
A single thought gives birth to a devil,

114
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,100
doomed to the abyss forever.

115
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,780
The land is laid to waste,

116
00:05:58,630 --> 00:05:59,700
its ruins heaped with bones."

117
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,900
Every ancient text I find

118
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,580
that speaks of the Devil Incarnate

119
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,660
foretells annihilation.

120
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,780
Is there really

121
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,020
no way in this world

122
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,100
to save his life

123
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:18,020
and keep him from slaughtering others?

124
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:32,810
What is this place?

125
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,460
Since when has Luoshen Valley

126
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,730
had vines that reach the sky?

127
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:44,220
Master?

128
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:47,930
What are you doing here?

129
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:50,580
I was looking for a few books to read.

130
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,700
I ended up all the way at the back

131
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,100
and found a door.

132
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:54,980
Master,

133
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,610
what is this place?

134
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,780
How did I never know

135
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,700
a place like this existed?

136
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:00,900
These vines

137
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:02,140
reach into the clouds.

138
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:03,610
Yet I've never seen them

139
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,460
when looking at Luoshen Valley from afar.

140
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:08,050
How is that possible?

141
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,340
These

142
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,340
are no ordinary vines.

143
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,700
They form a heavenly ladder.

144
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:14,850
A heavenly ladder?

145
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,730
I've stood guard in Luoshen Valley for 1,000 years.

146
00:08:19,870 --> 00:08:21,060
My duty is to guard

147
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:22,370
the Saintess's Shrine

148
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,020
and, above all, this heavenly ladder,

149
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:26,250
a symbol of peace throughout the world.

150
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,980
If it's a heavenly ladder,

151
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,340
where does it lead?

152
00:08:30,830 --> 00:08:31,660
Can I climb it?

153
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,220
You weren't meant

154
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,100
to know about this yet.

155
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,580
When the time is right,

156
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:36,580
I'll tell you.

157
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,850
Why can't you tell me now?

158
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,820
How many more secrets does Luoshen Valley hold?

159
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,650
Master,

160
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:41,920
why are you keeping so much

161
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:42,530
from me?

162
00:08:42,910 --> 00:08:44,140
When you're no longer so fixated

163
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:45,530
on Qi Fengyin,

164
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:48,370
you can ask me about the ladder again.

165
00:08:49,910 --> 00:08:50,580
I...

166
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,060
Back then,

167
00:08:53,270 --> 00:08:54,810
when did you ever care

168
00:08:54,810 --> 00:08:55,580
what was in the library?

169
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,820
These past few days, you've barely eaten

170
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:58,770
or slept,

171
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,890
all to find a way to get Qi Fengyin back

172
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:02,060
on the right path.

173
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,300
You've already cut ties with him.

174
00:09:03,670 --> 00:09:04,580
Why do you

175
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:05,730
keep wavering like this?

176
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,770
I'm just trying to find a way

177
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:11,420
to stop him from becoming the Devil Incarnate.

178
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:23,420
Yamao,

179
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:24,850
go pack your things.

180
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,730
Tomorrow, we'll leave

181
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,940
for Luoliang Immortal City.

182
00:09:44,150 --> 00:09:44,730
Qi Fengyin!

183
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:45,820
Let go of my master!

184
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,770
Take him.

185
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,300
Master!

186
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,730
What did you do to him?

187
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,890
I turned him back into a rock,

188
00:09:58,670 --> 00:10:00,370
just like before.

189
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,890
I like him better this way.

190
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,530
Qi Fengyin,

191
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,130
I should've killed you long ago.

192
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,610
Here's your master's soul.

193
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,180
If you want him to wake up,

194
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,100
come with me.

195
00:10:27,150 --> 00:10:28,220
Come on in, folks!

196
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:29,340
Take a look!

197
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,620
Come on in and have a look!

198
00:10:32,030 --> 00:10:32,940
Take a look!

199
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,820
Welcome, folks!

200
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,980
Come in and see what we've got!

201
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,700
Come on in!

202
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:39,770
I've sent word to Mount Zhaowu

203
00:10:39,790 --> 00:10:40,730
about what happened.

204
00:10:41,270 --> 00:10:42,820
They'll take good care of my master.

205
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,220
But his soul...

206
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:48,890
Don't get any ideas.

207
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:50,850
I know what you're thinking.

208
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,300
You might fool others,

209
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:53,650
but you won't fool me.

210
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:54,890
I've done as you asked

211
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:55,820
and left Luoshen Valley.

212
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,370
What do I have to do

213
00:10:57,670 --> 00:10:59,180
to get my master's soul back?

214
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,250
Wait until the mystical flower blooms.

215
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:02,890
I've already found

216
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,100
the last wisp of malice.

217
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:09,460
[Veiled Moon Pavilion]

218
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,130
Madam.

219
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:25,300
I told you. The sect leader needs quiet to cultivate.

220
00:11:25,550 --> 00:11:27,220
No one is to go near this room.

221
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:29,730
But Luoliang Immortal Sect sent someone.

222
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,580
They say they have plenty to deal with

223
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,820
and want to know why Master Cang

224
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,750
has spent two nights at the Veiled Moon Pavilion.

225
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,700
His private affairs

226
00:11:35,750 --> 00:11:36,730
are none of your business.

227
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:37,460
Get lost!

228
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:39,610
Yes, understood.

229
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:51,170
Good thing I have His Lordship's mind-control spell.

230
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:52,820
Without it, it'd be such a pain

231
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,890
to keep an eye on someone here.

232
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:57,820
Still,

233
00:11:58,150 --> 00:11:59,180
the people from Luoliang Immortal Sect

234
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,490
are getting suspicious.

235
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,770
I don't know how much longer I can stall them.

236
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:03,980
Whatever happens,

237
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,460
I'll stand guard here

238
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,010
for His Lordship tonight.

239
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,530
Yamao?

240
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:22,820
What are you doing here?

241
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,980
I have her master's soul.

242
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,820
I didn't know anything about it!

243
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,530
It was His Lordship.

244
00:12:29,750 --> 00:12:31,130
He insisted on finding the woman

245
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,650
Cang Zhu can't get out of his head.

246
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:34,370
That's all I know.

247
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,220
Cang Zhu?

248
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,700
So the last wisp of malice

249
00:12:45,150 --> 00:12:45,980
is in him?

250
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:48,440
He once crossed paths

251
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:50,050
with a demoness named Yuji.

252
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:51,740
He married someone else,

253
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:54,470
but he's never forgotten her.

254
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:56,420
That's why he frequents the Veiled Moon Pavilion,

255
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:57,650
fascinated

256
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:59,530
by dancers who look like Yuji.

257
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,610
The last wisp of malice

258
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:05,530
clings to his thread of fate.

259
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,890
The Wish Tree will appear soon.

260
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:10,130
If we can get Yuji to show herself,

261
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,420
he won't pass up the chance

262
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,890
to bind his fate to hers.

263
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:17,330
So when they bind their fates,

264
00:13:17,330 --> 00:13:18,970
we can reclaim the malice.

265
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:20,460
But Yuji

266
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,560
vanished 100 years ago.

267
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,490
Cang Zhu's searched for ages with no luck.

268
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:24,490
Where are we going to find her

269
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:25,220
on such short notice?

270
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:27,770
He suffers from headaches.

271
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:29,420
Only Yuji's water magic

272
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,370
can give him any relief.

273
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:35,100
So all I need

274
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:37,180
is someone who can ease

275
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:38,060
his headaches.

276
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,340
Is that why you brought me here?

277
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:42,300
You want me to use healing magic

278
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,370
to ease his headaches,

279
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:44,650
then pretend to be Yuji

280
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:46,130
and trick him out of his thread of fate?

281
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,120
That won't work.

282
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,460
We could

283
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:51,650
use a transformation spell

284
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:52,940
to make Yamao look like Yuji,

285
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,420
but she doesn't know

286
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,630
what happened between them.

287
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:56,770
The moment they talk,

288
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,460
he'll know something's off.

289
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,370
Then I'll show her.

290
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:02,850
What are you doing?

291
00:14:03,150 --> 00:14:04,220
Stand guard outside.

292
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:06,180
Don't let anyone disturb us.

293
00:14:13,150 --> 00:14:14,060
My master's soul

294
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,250
is still in Qi Fengyin's hands.

295
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,010
For now, I have to play along

296
00:14:17,550 --> 00:14:18,580
and wait for the right moment.

297
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:19,850
Once we enter his mind

298
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,850
and step into his dream,

299
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:24,060
his past will unfold before us.

300
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:57,850
I've spent days refining this Xuanji Orb

301
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,250
and made no progress at all.

302
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:00,840
[Cang Zhu, Heir to Luoliang Immortal Sect]

303
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,060
What am I going to do

304
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:02,850
at the Celestial Artifact Trials?

305
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:05,650
Cang Zhu.

306
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,650
Zhu.

307
00:15:07,790 --> 00:15:08,300
Yuanming.

308
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,250
The Trials are still days away.

309
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,770
Don't stay cooped up in here training.

310
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:14,980
Come to the study.

311
00:15:15,670 --> 00:15:16,980
I just got hold of a remarkable fish

312
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:18,770
and brought it here to show you.

313
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:19,940
Zhu, I know

314
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,250
you've seen plenty of rarities since childhood,

315
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:22,060
but I promise

316
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:23,220
you've never seen

317
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:24,700
anything this extraordinary.

318
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,730
Cang Xun, Yuanming,

319
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:31,370
I'll pass.

320
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:32,220
Right now,

321
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:33,820
all I want is to refine this Xuanji Orb.

322
00:15:34,270 --> 00:15:35,420
Everything else

323
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:36,890
can wait.

324
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,420
Cang Zhu, you're an excellent painter.

325
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:41,220
Could you spare a moment

326
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,580
to paint a portrait

327
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:43,730
of this remarkable fish?

328
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,420
Come on.

329
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:47,830
It's just one painting.

330
00:15:47,830 --> 00:15:48,240
Let's go.

331
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,060
- Sit. - Just watch.

332
00:15:57,550 --> 00:15:58,530
Watch closely.

333
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:04,700
Look, Zhu!

334
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:06,250
What a beautiful moonlight fish.

335
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,060
It's a fine fish.

336
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:12,100
It is.

337
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:35,940
Remarkable.

338
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:37,980
What do you think?

339
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:39,730
You agree with me, right?

340
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,490
It's truly one of a kind.

341
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:44,730
Zhu,

342
00:16:45,750 --> 00:16:47,940
make sure you do it justice.

343
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,180
Yuanming,

344
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,820
you're keeping it right here.

345
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,060
You can see it day and night.

346
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:55,130
Why bother painting a portrait of it?

347
00:16:57,270 --> 00:16:58,220
I'm keeping it

348
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:01,250
so I can pluck its scales to make a magical artifact.

349
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,890
Yuanming,

350
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:06,330
didn't you say you bought it for display?

351
00:17:07,310 --> 00:17:08,900
This goldfish is brimming with spiritual power.

352
00:17:09,590 --> 00:17:10,460
Keeping it just for show

353
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,090
would be a terrible waste.

354
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:14,250
I'll use its scales

355
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:15,290
to make

356
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:17,380
a flexible coat of armor no blade or spear can pierce.

357
00:17:17,790 --> 00:17:19,090
One fish won't give you

358
00:17:19,350 --> 00:17:20,180
enough scales.

359
00:17:20,550 --> 00:17:22,200
Then I'll wait for its scales to grow back

360
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:22,860
and pluck them again.

361
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,180
If I keep doing that,

362
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,620
I'll have enough eventually.

363
00:17:26,550 --> 00:17:27,900
But before I pluck them,

364
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,010
I'd like a painting

365
00:17:29,030 --> 00:17:29,980
to preserve what it looks like now.

366
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,140
Otherwise, when I tell people about it,

367
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:33,050
they might not believe me.

368
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,050
Fair point.

369
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:34,570
Zhu,

370
00:17:35,310 --> 00:17:36,380
I'm counting on you for the painting.

371
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,500
No, Yuanming!

372
00:17:38,670 --> 00:17:39,900
- That's cruel! - Enough!

373
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,620
- Let's go. - Zhu!

374
00:17:42,030 --> 00:17:43,140
- Don't listen to him! - Everybody out!

375
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,050
- Let's go. - Come on.

376
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:56,180
Sir,

377
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:57,530
please save me.

378
00:18:03,510 --> 00:18:05,250
Sir, I'm over here.

379
00:18:12,110 --> 00:18:12,940
You can talk?

380
00:18:13,510 --> 00:18:15,250
I cultivated for 100 years in the Eastern Sea.

381
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:16,770
My spirit awakened long ago.

382
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:17,860
Of course I can talk.

383
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:20,180
The Eastern Sea is over 1,000 li away.

384
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,090
How did you get caught?

385
00:18:23,790 --> 00:18:25,090
It's my fault. I was fooling around

386
00:18:25,510 --> 00:18:26,730
and got caught.

387
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:28,490
They put me in this porcelain bowl

388
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:30,010
and sealed away my powers,

389
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:31,730
so I can't escape.

390
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:34,010
This was made from a fragment of the Demon-Refining Vessel.

391
00:18:34,310 --> 00:18:35,660
No wonder it can seal away her demonic power.

392
00:18:36,070 --> 00:18:36,700
Sir,

393
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,570
I'm a fish demon from the Eastern Sea,

394
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:40,420
but I've never harmed anyone.

395
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,530
The others just stood there watching.

396
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,140
You were the only one who looked at me with pity.

397
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,050
That's why I plucked up the courage to ask for help.

398
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,860
Please, sir, have mercy

399
00:18:49,110 --> 00:18:49,860
and spare my life.

400
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:52,810
I really do want to let you go.

401
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:54,730
But...

402
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,460
Yuanming bought you.

403
00:18:59,270 --> 00:19:00,330
If I free you without his permission,

404
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:02,980
it'll come between us.

405
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:05,900
Don't worry, sir.

406
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:07,330
I won't get you in trouble.

407
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:09,010
You won't have to do anything yourself.

408
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,220
Sir,

409
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,220
come closer.

410
00:19:14,270 --> 00:19:16,250
All you have to do, sir, is...

411
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:26,490
You're quite the painter, Zhu.

412
00:19:27,070 --> 00:19:28,050
That was quick.

413
00:19:29,830 --> 00:19:30,460
Yuanming,

414
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,460
this moonlight fish is rare indeed,

415
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,910
but this little porcelain bowl

416
00:19:34,910 --> 00:19:35,700
is just too plain.

417
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:38,940
I can't find the inspiration

418
00:19:39,590 --> 00:19:40,770
to paint the fish properly.

419
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:42,530
I see.

420
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:43,330
In that case,

421
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,330
I'll go find a more unusual vessel.

422
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:46,770
You can paint it tomorrow.

423
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:48,420
I'll take my leave, Zhu.

424
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:49,620
See you, Yuanming.

425
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:56,570
What do you think?

426
00:19:57,750 --> 00:19:58,980
This tank is crystal clear

427
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:00,420
and beautifully shaped.

428
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,380
Now it suits the little fish.

429
00:20:03,310 --> 00:20:04,460
Come on, get started.

430
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:05,810
Don't waste my brother's time.

431
00:21:07,270 --> 00:21:07,730
Yuanming...

432
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:11,250
My moonlight fish!

433
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:19,250
That crooked merchant must be in league with that demon.

434
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:20,890
How dare he trick me!

435
00:21:21,510 --> 00:21:22,570
He'll pay for this!

436
00:21:26,750 --> 00:21:27,730
It's a good thing it got away.

437
00:21:28,590 --> 00:21:30,290
If he'd gone through with making the armor,

438
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,200
the poor little fish

439
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,330
would've suffered horribly.

440
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,530
You're right.

441
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:38,330
How could Luoliang Immortal Sect

442
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:39,810
ever make artifacts

443
00:21:39,830 --> 00:21:41,010
by such cruel means?

444
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:49,530
Even so,

445
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:51,620
I caused Yuanming to lose

446
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:52,940
something important to him.

447
00:21:55,590 --> 00:21:56,700
When I get the chance,

448
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,730
I'll apologize and make it up to him.

449
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,620
Thank you for saving me, sir.

450
00:22:20,790 --> 00:22:21,140
You...

451
00:22:21,590 --> 00:22:22,980
It's me, the little goldfish.

452
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:29,290
I thought you'd escaped.

453
00:22:30,270 --> 00:22:32,330
I only just took human form. My cultivation is weak.

454
00:22:32,510 --> 00:22:34,140
How could I have escaped from an immortal cultivator?

455
00:22:35,510 --> 00:22:37,050
What you saw was an illusion.

456
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,620
I was hiding in your sleeve.

457
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,420
Now that you're free,

458
00:23:00,350 --> 00:23:01,860
you should hurry back to the Eastern Sea.

459
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:03,950
But that bowl has drained

460
00:23:03,950 --> 00:23:05,220
all my spiritual power.

461
00:23:05,510 --> 00:23:06,490
If I go out now,

462
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,980
they'll catch me again for sure.

463
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,420
Cang Zhu,

464
00:23:10,070 --> 00:23:11,010
please be kind

465
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,010
and take me in.

466
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,460
How do you know my name?

467
00:23:14,790 --> 00:23:16,220
I heard the others call you that.

468
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:19,570
Cang Zhu,

469
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:20,980
I promise I won't cause you any trouble.

470
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:22,620
Once I've regained some spiritual power

471
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:24,010
and put on a little weight,

472
00:23:24,270 --> 00:23:25,140
I'll leave right away.

473
00:23:26,110 --> 00:23:26,940
To repay you,

474
00:23:27,350 --> 00:23:28,660
I can even marry you.

475
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,140
That won't be necessary.

476
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,860
My heart already belongs to someone else.

477
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:37,810
Well...

478
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,730
While you're painting,

479
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:42,490
I can glow and light the room for you.

480
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:43,610
That'll save you

481
00:23:43,610 --> 00:23:45,240
quite a bit on candles.

482
00:23:45,310 --> 00:23:46,140
I'm quite useful.

483
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:48,140
That's hardly necessary either.

484
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:50,010
I've got plenty of silver for candles.

485
00:23:54,510 --> 00:23:55,220
Well...

486
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,900
I... I'll think of something else.

487
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:04,180
Cang Zhu,

488
00:24:04,350 --> 00:24:05,390
I'm sure I can think

489
00:24:05,390 --> 00:24:06,490
of something you'd be happy with.

490
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,700
Please take me in.

491
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:14,140
I promise I'll repay your kindness.

492
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:18,090
You don't have to repay me.

493
00:24:21,030 --> 00:24:22,250
Just stay hidden here

494
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:24,420
and make sure no one else finds you.

495
00:24:55,140 --> 00:24:59,380
♪Moonlight spills before Luoliang's towers♪

496
00:24:59,420 --> 00:25:03,700
♪The evening breeze caresses your face♪

497
00:25:03,980 --> 00:25:08,460
♪My sleepless heart stirs with love again and again♪

498
00:25:08,740 --> 00:25:13,460
♪Yet my longing only grows harder to soothe♪

499
00:25:14,340 --> 00:25:18,060
♪In the hush, fireflies fill the sky♪

500
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:22,820
♪Your silhouette dances lightly♪

501
00:25:23,300 --> 00:25:28,260
♪Let the years become two butterflies breaking free of their cocoons♪

502
00:25:28,700 --> 00:25:33,420
♪We'll brave every calamity this world holds♪

503
00:25:34,820 --> 00:25:37,980
♪Time drifts gently, your backward glance cool and clear♪

504
00:25:38,340 --> 00:25:40,340
♪Grace in every step♪

505
00:25:40,820 --> 00:25:44,300
♪I wander the mortal world for you alone♪

506
00:25:44,820 --> 00:25:46,900
♪The scent of pear blossoms fills the air♪

507
00:25:47,460 --> 00:25:49,380
♪Threads of karma are drawn together♪

508
00:25:49,820 --> 00:25:53,540
♪Twining around our palms, layer upon layer♪

509
00:25:54,100 --> 00:25:57,340
♪Time drifts gently, your backward glance cool and clear♪

510
00:25:57,620 --> 00:25:59,700
♪Grace in every step♪

511
00:25:59,780 --> 00:26:03,700
♪Snow dusts my horse's hooves as I ride to meet you♪

512
00:26:04,140 --> 00:26:05,900
♪Shadows sway in the lamplight♪

513
00:26:06,260 --> 00:26:08,020
♪How could I refuse such a warm invitation?♪

514
00:26:08,540 --> 00:26:10,340
♪Bonds and memories♪

515
00:26:10,740 --> 00:26:17,140
♪Weave us together, thread by thread♪

516
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:28,380
Cang Zhu!

517
00:26:31,160 --> 00:26:31,900
Here, sit down.

518
00:26:37,590 --> 00:26:39,700
My water magic can heal wounds and ease pain.

519
00:26:43,750 --> 00:26:44,380
Look at you.

520
00:26:44,550 --> 00:26:46,010
You never take care of yourself.

521
00:26:46,510 --> 00:26:47,700
Why put so much effort

522
00:26:47,750 --> 00:26:48,420
into that stupid artifact?

523
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,570
I have to win first place

524
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:51,660
at the Celestial Artifact Trials.

525
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:54,380
But you're already the heir to the sect.

526
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:55,980
Why should it matter

527
00:26:56,030 --> 00:26:57,090
whether you come in first?

528
00:26:57,510 --> 00:26:58,860
It's for the woman I love,

529
00:26:59,200 --> 00:26:59,770
Ruoshi.

530
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:01,810
Ruoshi and I

531
00:27:03,270 --> 00:27:04,290
grew up together,

532
00:27:05,270 --> 00:27:06,290
and we're in love.

533
00:27:06,830 --> 00:27:08,810
What does that have to do

534
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:09,700
with refining the artifact?

535
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:10,900
Here's the thing.

536
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:12,980
Luoliang Immortal Sect

537
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:15,010
rarely lets its disciples marry each other.

538
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,770
They worry

539
00:27:17,030 --> 00:27:19,420
we'll get swept up in romance and neglect our cultivation.

540
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:21,700
Only if I come in first

541
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:22,940
at the Celestial Artifact Trials

542
00:27:23,830 --> 00:27:25,380
will my father believe

543
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:27,180
that my cultivation has improved

544
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:30,180
and that I can lead the sect one day.

545
00:27:30,790 --> 00:27:31,620
Only then

546
00:27:32,640 --> 00:27:34,620
will he approve our marriage.

547
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:37,570
No.

548
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:38,860
For Ruoshi's sake,

549
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:40,290
I can't afford to slack off anymore.

550
00:27:41,070 --> 00:27:41,810
Cang Zhu...

551
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:56,330
You've been so busy training

552
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:57,810
that you've lost weight.

553
00:27:58,550 --> 00:27:58,980
Here.

554
00:28:00,110 --> 00:28:00,900
Eat one.

555
00:28:13,310 --> 00:28:14,010
Is it good?

556
00:28:39,420 --> 00:28:42,140
[Mingse Hall]

557
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:46,860
Cang Zhu,

558
00:28:47,790 --> 00:28:49,250
was the woman who brought you pastries today

559
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:51,250
Ruoshi, the one you love?

560
00:28:52,310 --> 00:28:53,700
Soon, we won't be able

561
00:28:54,720 --> 00:28:56,180
to see each other anymore.

562
00:28:57,030 --> 00:28:57,660
Why not?

563
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:03,570
Demons keep attacking a nearby town.

564
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,980
Ruoshi's been sent to guard it.

565
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,420
And now I'm too sick to get out of bed.

566
00:29:10,790 --> 00:29:12,770
I doubt I can refine the Xuanji Orb

567
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:14,220
at the Celestial Artifact Trials.

568
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:16,460
If I can't prove myself,

569
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:18,220
Ruoshi and I

570
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:20,730
will never be able to see each other again.

571
00:29:26,510 --> 00:29:27,420
Cang Zhu,

572
00:29:28,070 --> 00:29:28,860
don't worry.

573
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:29,900
I'm here.

574
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:31,270
Your injuries will heal

575
00:29:31,270 --> 00:29:31,980
in no time.

576
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:33,860
My water magic works wonders.

577
00:29:34,680 --> 00:29:35,770
Just give it your all.

578
00:29:36,790 --> 00:29:38,180
I'm sure you can do it.

579
00:29:44,350 --> 00:29:45,570
Today's Celestial Artifact Trials

580
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,770
will test your ability

581
00:29:46,790 --> 00:29:48,050
to wield magical artifacts.

582
00:29:48,790 --> 00:29:50,660
The Xuanji Orb draws spiritual energy from Heaven and Earth.

583
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,290
Its spiritual power is immense but hard to control.

584
00:29:52,790 --> 00:29:54,570
The Celestial Astrolabe is an ancient divine artifact

585
00:29:54,830 --> 00:29:55,940
and our sect's greatest treasure.

586
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:57,730
The two strengthen and restrain each other.

587
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,910
Whoever can guide the Xuanji Orb

588
00:29:59,910 --> 00:30:01,140
into the Celestial Astrolabe,

589
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,770
refine the orb,

590
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:04,010
and withstand the lightning strikes

591
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:05,380
will be

592
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:07,380
the winner of the Celestial Artifact Trials.

593
00:30:17,070 --> 00:30:18,010
That's the chief disciple for you.

594
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:19,180
His skill with artifacts

595
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:20,770
far surpasses ours.

596
00:30:21,550 --> 00:30:23,420
Right. Yuanming's incredible.

597
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:12,380
Oh, no.

598
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:14,010
Every time Zhu gets this far,

599
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:15,290
the power surging

600
00:31:15,310 --> 00:31:16,530
from the Xuanji Orb overwhelms him.

601
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:27,940
For Ruoshi's sake,

602
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:29,980
I have to keep fighting it,

603
00:31:30,350 --> 00:31:31,770
whatever it takes.

604
00:31:39,550 --> 00:31:39,860
He...

605
00:32:15,110 --> 00:32:15,700
He did it!

606
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:31,330
My son has come into his own.

607
00:32:31,550 --> 00:32:33,140
Splendid! What a feat!

608
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:35,980
Father,

609
00:32:36,110 --> 00:32:37,140
Zhu took first place!

610
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:38,460
What reward do you want, Zhu?

611
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:39,700
Ask Father for it.

612
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:40,620
I'm sure he'll grant it.

613
00:32:47,240 --> 00:32:47,810
Father,

614
00:32:49,070 --> 00:32:49,980
I want no other reward.

615
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:51,660
I only ask

616
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:54,660
for your blessing to marry Ruoshi.

617
00:32:58,400 --> 00:32:58,900
Yuji,

618
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:00,460
I did it!

619
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:18,050
What happened to you?

620
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,940
Is this why I couldn't find you anywhere?

621
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:25,330
You hid

622
00:33:25,400 --> 00:33:26,700
in the Xuanji Orb

623
00:33:27,310 --> 00:33:28,660
and took the lightning strikes for me?

624
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:33,980
Cang Zhu,

625
00:33:34,310 --> 00:33:34,940
I told you

626
00:33:35,550 --> 00:33:36,570
you could do it.

627
00:33:38,030 --> 00:33:38,420
But...

628
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:41,330
But I never wanted this.

629
00:33:42,270 --> 00:33:43,730
Only a scoundrel

630
00:33:45,070 --> 00:33:46,530
would win this way.

631
00:33:47,440 --> 00:33:48,490
It brings shame on my sect.

632
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,110
Why did you do this

633
00:33:51,110 --> 00:33:52,090
without asking me first?

634
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:53,770
I was only trying to help,

635
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:55,460
and you call me a scoundrel?

636
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:57,810
Do you want to marry Ruoshi or not?

637
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:05,810
Let's drop it.

638
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:09,090
You've lost a lot of vital energy.

639
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:12,300
Staying in human form will damage your demonic core.

640
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:13,860
Focus on recovery for now.

641
00:34:23,660 --> 00:34:31,980
[Mingse Hall]

642
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:54,010
Father.

643
00:34:54,670 --> 00:34:56,010
Get on your knees.

644
00:35:02,030 --> 00:35:02,690
Zhu,

645
00:35:03,590 --> 00:35:04,780
Master already knows.

646
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,260
Admit what you did

647
00:35:06,550 --> 00:35:07,420
so he'll calm down.

648
00:35:07,550 --> 00:35:09,420
Hand over that demon now!

649
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:13,860
Father,

650
00:35:15,030 --> 00:35:16,610
I did take a shortcut.

651
00:35:17,510 --> 00:35:18,460
I know it was wrong.

652
00:35:19,110 --> 00:35:20,380
But there really is no fish demon.

653
00:35:21,030 --> 00:35:22,380
Still lying?

654
00:35:23,150 --> 00:35:24,050
You're a disgrace,

655
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,130
so stubborn

656
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:27,860
and utterly unrepentant!

657
00:35:29,760 --> 00:35:30,300
Father,

658
00:35:30,510 --> 00:35:31,690
it was that cunning fish demon...

659
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:32,260
Step aside!

660
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:35,460
Zhu,

661
00:35:36,030 --> 00:35:36,780
given your level of skill,

662
00:35:37,230 --> 00:35:37,980
there's no way

663
00:35:38,230 --> 00:35:38,900
you could've refined

664
00:35:38,920 --> 00:35:39,650
the Xuanji Orb on your own.

665
00:35:40,150 --> 00:35:41,340
Just hand over the fish demon.

666
00:35:41,550 --> 00:35:42,980
There is no fish demon.

667
00:35:43,030 --> 00:35:44,150
Still talking back?

668
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:45,570
I said there isn't one.

669
00:35:50,510 --> 00:35:52,180
You're no son of mine!

670
00:35:55,670 --> 00:35:56,300
Master,

671
00:35:56,630 --> 00:35:57,570
we've found the fish demon.

672
00:35:58,110 --> 00:35:59,340
It was in Cang Zhu's chamber.

673
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:01,860
Master,

674
00:36:02,510 --> 00:36:03,940
this is the fish demon Cang Zhu was consorting with,

675
00:36:04,070 --> 00:36:05,420
the one that led him astray.

676
00:36:16,030 --> 00:36:17,300
It's just an ordinary goldfish.

677
00:36:18,360 --> 00:36:19,010
Impossible.

678
00:36:20,230 --> 00:36:21,130
I saw the fish demon there

679
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:22,090
with my own eyes.

680
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:23,690
I even used its scales

681
00:36:23,710 --> 00:36:24,780
to make Spirit-Draining Extract.

682
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:27,170
I...

683
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:30,260
Spirit-Draining Extract?

684
00:36:34,030 --> 00:36:36,900
It strips the Xuanji Orb of its spiritual power.

685
00:36:37,150 --> 00:36:38,530
Why did you make it?

686
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:39,980
Master,

687
00:36:42,670 --> 00:36:43,260
I...

688
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,530
My brother's Xuanji Orb

689
00:36:59,710 --> 00:37:00,820
has Spirit-Draining Extract in it?

690
00:37:01,710 --> 00:37:02,420
Isn't Spirit-Draining Extract

691
00:37:03,150 --> 00:37:04,980
used to suppress an artifact's spiritual power?

692
00:37:09,070 --> 00:37:09,940
Yuanming!

693
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:12,300
Master,

694
00:37:12,920 --> 00:37:13,690
I was wrong.

695
00:37:17,670 --> 00:37:18,300
Disciples!

696
00:37:19,110 --> 00:37:20,690
Cast this schemer

697
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:22,490
out of the sect!

698
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:23,940
Master!

699
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,610
I know I was wrong, Master!

700
00:37:26,150 --> 00:37:26,650
Master!

701
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,210
Master, I know I was wrong!

702
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:30,610
Master!

703
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:44,260
Yuji.

704
00:37:50,190 --> 00:37:50,900
Where are you?

705
00:37:53,190 --> 00:37:54,820
Cang Zhu, I'm here.

706
00:38:02,550 --> 00:38:03,130
Thank goodness.

707
00:38:03,630 --> 00:38:04,260
You're all right.

708
00:38:06,710 --> 00:38:07,690
Good thing I acted fast.

709
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:09,210
I scooped up a fish from the pond out back

710
00:38:09,230 --> 00:38:10,260
and used it to fool them.

711
00:38:11,230 --> 00:38:11,820
Anyway,

712
00:38:12,110 --> 00:38:13,210
after such a harsh punishment,

713
00:38:13,630 --> 00:38:14,860
how can you act like nothing happened?

714
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:15,980
I'm fine.

715
00:38:16,710 --> 00:38:17,380
Guess what?

716
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,260
Turns out I could've refined

717
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:20,300
the Xuanji Orb long ago.

718
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:21,980
I kept failing

719
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:23,130
because Yuanming

720
00:38:23,190 --> 00:38:23,940
had tampered

721
00:38:24,510 --> 00:38:25,690
with my artifact.

722
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:26,860
I knew it.

723
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,420
He had a shifty look in his eyes.

724
00:38:28,480 --> 00:38:29,340
I knew he was trouble.

725
00:38:29,510 --> 00:38:31,190
I'll teach him a lesson for you!

726
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:32,530
There's no need.

727
00:38:33,230 --> 00:38:34,980
He's already been expelled from the sect.

728
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:37,170
After everything he put you through,

729
00:38:37,510 --> 00:38:38,860
how can you let him off so easily?

730
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,090
It's all right.

731
00:38:41,030 --> 00:38:42,010
After what happened,

732
00:38:42,920 --> 00:38:44,530
I realized keeping you here in the sect

733
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:45,820
would be too dangerous.

734
00:38:46,630 --> 00:38:47,460
The top priority now

735
00:38:47,670 --> 00:38:48,740
is to get you back to the Eastern Sea.

736
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:53,010
But

737
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:54,780
my wounds haven't healed yet.

738
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:56,170
That's all right.

739
00:38:56,670 --> 00:38:58,170
I'll help you heal. It won't take long.

740
00:39:41,260 --> 00:39:47,220
[Mingse Hall]

741
00:39:58,590 --> 00:39:59,130
What's wrong?

742
00:40:01,710 --> 00:40:03,380
I've recovered all my spiritual power.

743
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:05,130
I can return to the Eastern Sea tonight.

744
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:08,690
Cang Zhu,

745
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:11,900
will you see me off?

746
00:40:27,190 --> 00:40:28,300
This is as far as I'll go.

747
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:31,740
Don't fool around again

748
00:40:32,190 --> 00:40:33,090
and get yourself caught.

749
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:54,780
I didn't think we'd get here so soon.

750
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,340
Cang Zhu,

751
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,050
can I ask you something?

752
00:41:12,030 --> 00:41:12,780
Would you

753
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:13,820
come to the Eastern Sea with me?

754
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:28,090
Do you have to go back?

755
00:41:34,320 --> 00:41:34,900
Of course.

756
00:41:35,880 --> 00:41:38,170
You're the heir to Luoliang Immortal Sect.

757
00:41:39,230 --> 00:41:40,050
You have great responsibilities.

758
00:41:40,510 --> 00:41:42,690
One day, you'll lead the whole sect.

759
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:44,980
How could you come with me?

760
00:41:46,180 --> 00:41:50,380
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

761
00:41:50,740 --> 00:41:54,140
♪So many longings♪

762
00:41:54,500 --> 00:41:56,660
♪Linger in the web of fate...♪

763
00:41:57,550 --> 00:41:58,380
Cang Zhu,

764
00:41:59,230 --> 00:42:00,530
thank you for saving me.

765
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:02,900
I've really enjoyed our time together.

766
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:04,940
Tonight,

767
00:42:06,630 --> 00:42:07,980
let me dance for you one last time.

768
00:42:11,380 --> 00:42:13,340
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

769
00:42:13,500 --> 00:42:21,100
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

770
00:42:22,180 --> 00:42:25,980
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

771
00:42:26,060 --> 00:42:30,220
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

772
00:42:30,300 --> 00:42:34,060
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

773
00:42:34,340 --> 00:42:38,460
♪Still waits to come true♪

774
00:42:38,580 --> 00:42:43,020
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

775
00:42:43,060 --> 00:42:46,980
♪I'll stay by your side♪

776
00:42:47,380 --> 00:42:50,980
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

777
00:42:51,340 --> 00:42:53,900
♪When the dream ends♪

778
00:42:54,420 --> 00:42:56,420
♪We'll have no regrets♪

779
00:43:11,380 --> 00:43:15,420
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

780
00:43:15,820 --> 00:43:19,340
♪So many longings♪

781
00:43:19,420 --> 00:43:22,100
♪Linger in the web of fate...♪

782
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,740
First, bow to Heaven and Earth.

783
00:43:30,320 --> 00:43:32,260
Second, bow to your parents.

784
00:43:32,540 --> 00:43:36,380
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

785
00:43:36,780 --> 00:43:38,780
♪One look into each other's eyes...♪

786
00:43:42,190 --> 00:43:43,940
Third, bow to each other.

787
00:43:47,220 --> 00:43:50,860
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

788
00:43:51,260 --> 00:43:55,260
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

789
00:43:55,300 --> 00:43:59,140
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

790
00:43:59,220 --> 00:44:03,380
♪Still waits to come true♪

791
00:44:03,580 --> 00:44:07,980
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

792
00:44:08,100 --> 00:44:12,060
♪I'll stay by your side♪

793
00:44:12,180 --> 00:44:15,940
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

794
00:44:16,380 --> 00:44:18,780
♪When the dream ends♪

795
00:44:19,260 --> 00:44:23,780
♪We'll have no regrets♪

796
00:44:25,230 --> 00:44:26,460
The rituals are complete!

797
00:45:07,630 --> 00:45:08,940
You've been painting all day, honey.

798
00:45:09,230 --> 00:45:10,300
You must be tired.

799
00:45:10,550 --> 00:45:11,420
I made some

800
00:45:11,440 --> 00:45:12,420
of your favorite pear pastries.

801
00:45:12,630 --> 00:45:13,300
Try one.

802
00:45:18,880 --> 00:45:19,860
Much as I like them,

803
00:45:20,710 --> 00:45:21,980
I can't eat them every day.

804
00:45:28,760 --> 00:45:29,690
Leave them here.

805
00:45:30,550 --> 00:45:31,340
You don't have to keep me company.

806
00:45:32,590 --> 00:45:33,300
Go on with your day.

807
00:46:13,670 --> 00:46:14,170
Yuji...

808
00:46:15,800 --> 00:46:16,380
Yuji...

809
00:46:17,510 --> 00:46:18,010
Yuji...

810
00:46:20,280 --> 00:46:20,820
Yuji!

811
00:46:21,670 --> 00:46:22,570
When you were young,

812
00:46:23,230 --> 00:46:24,980
you did everything you could to marry the woman you loved.

813
00:46:25,630 --> 00:46:27,300
After years together,

814
00:46:27,710 --> 00:46:29,170
you found that life dull

815
00:46:29,760 --> 00:46:31,420
and began to miss the moments that disrupted

816
00:46:31,670 --> 00:46:33,050
your otherwise peaceful life.

817
00:46:34,280 --> 00:46:35,780
The things people yearn for...

818
00:46:36,230 --> 00:46:38,170
How pitiful. How absurd.

819
00:46:40,070 --> 00:46:41,090
What you saw in the dream

820
00:46:42,760 --> 00:46:44,090
was your own past.

821
00:46:49,360 --> 00:46:50,570
All this time,

822
00:46:51,710 --> 00:46:54,010
you've been Yuji.

823
00:47:12,150 --> 00:47:13,170
After years of searching,

824
00:47:13,360 --> 00:47:14,650
I finally found Yuji.

825
00:47:14,920 --> 00:47:16,680
Now that the Wish Tree has appeared,

826
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:18,050
I'll bind my fate to hers.

827
00:47:18,280 --> 00:47:19,420
Do you really expect Yamao

828
00:47:19,420 --> 00:47:20,740
to give up her own identity

829
00:47:20,880 --> 00:47:21,980
and live as Yuji for the rest of her life?

830
00:47:22,230 --> 00:47:24,050
Whatever the cost,

831
00:47:25,440 --> 00:47:27,010
I must reclaim that wisp of malice.

832
00:47:27,230 --> 00:47:28,740
If this is what you want,

833
00:47:29,320 --> 00:47:30,210
I'll do it.

834
00:48:02,460 --> 00:48:08,220
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

835
00:48:09,700 --> 00:48:15,340
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

836
00:48:15,980 --> 00:48:22,860
♪One thought sows karma. Who knows right from wrong? Love entwines the stars♪

837
00:48:22,980 --> 00:48:28,900
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

838
00:48:30,420 --> 00:48:36,060
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil blur, ensnaring you and me♪

839
00:48:37,740 --> 00:48:43,420
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

840
00:48:43,740 --> 00:48:48,180
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips♪

841
00:48:48,300 --> 00:48:51,260
♪Our vows live on in ink♪

842
00:48:51,380 --> 00:48:57,100
♪No matter what storms may rise behind us♪

843
00:48:57,940 --> 00:49:00,380
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

844
00:49:00,380 --> 00:49:04,980
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

845
00:49:04,980 --> 00:49:07,340
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife♪

846
00:49:07,340 --> 00:49:11,540
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

847
00:49:11,780 --> 00:49:14,060
♪Across vast mountains and rivers♪

848
00:49:14,060 --> 00:49:15,860
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

849
00:49:15,860 --> 00:49:18,780
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows♪

850
00:49:18,780 --> 00:49:20,940
♪Before all splendor fades♪

851
00:49:20,940 --> 00:49:25,580
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪

852
00:49:26,100 --> 00:49:28,500
♪In this life, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

853
00:49:28,540 --> 00:49:33,140
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

854
00:49:33,140 --> 00:49:35,500
♪We cannot escape the wind and snow♪

855
00:49:35,540 --> 00:49:39,700
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

856
00:49:39,940 --> 00:49:42,220
♪As seas turn to fields♪

857
00:49:42,220 --> 00:49:44,020
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

858
00:49:44,020 --> 00:49:46,940
♪Together, we'll break free of the cocoon fate has spun♪

859
00:49:46,940 --> 00:49:49,060
♪Before all splendor fades♪

860
00:49:49,060 --> 00:49:58,100
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪
